# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0014 (Root file system is not read-only)
# OpenBao server entrypoint copies and interpolates configuration in /tmp before launch,
# snapshot agent s3cmd writes temporary cache/config, and upstream server-test pod is ephemeral.
KSV-0014
AVD-KSV-0014

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0023 (hostPath volumes mounted)
# openbao-csi-provider daemonset requires hostPath volume to expose the provider socket to the node's kubelet CSI driver.
KSV-0023
AVD-KSV-0023

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0012 (Runs as root user)
# openbao-csi-provider requires root privileges to manage the provider socket in the root-owned hostPath directory.
KSV-0012
AVD-KSV-0012

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0048 (Manage Kubernetes workloads and pods)
# Upstream openbao-discovery-role requires pod access for cluster service registration and HA Raft peer discovery.
KSV-0048
AVD-KSV-0048

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0113 (Manage namespace secrets)
# Upstream openbao-csi-provider-role requires secret write access to synchronize HMAC key secrets.
KSV-0113
AVD-KSV-0113

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003 (Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all)
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0004 (Default capabilities: some containers do not drop any)
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0106 (Container capabilities must only include NET_BIND_SERVICE)
# OpenBao server requires IPC_LOCK capabilities for mlock memory protection, and upstream csi-agent / server-test containers.
KSV-0003
AVD-KSV-0003
KSV-0004
AVD-KSV-0004
KSV-0106
AVD-KSV-0106

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0015 (CPU requests not specified)
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0016 (Memory requests not specified)
# Upstream openbao-server-test pod hook does not specify resource requests.
KSV-0015
AVD-KSV-0015
KSV-0016
AVD-KSV-0016

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0030 (Runtime/Default Seccomp profile not set)
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0104 (Seccomp policies disabled)
# s3-bucket subchart backup cronjobs do not define custom seccomp profile in pod template.
KSV-0030
AVD-KSV-0030
KSV-0104
AVD-KSV-0104
